$DATUM α,β-Unsaturated Ester 26: To a solution of aldehyde S3 (2.09 g, 3.81
mmol) in benzene (60 mL) was added Ph3P=CHCO2Me (2.57 g, 7.62 mmol).
After the mixture was stirred at 40 °C for 2 h, purification by column
chromatography (hexane/EtOAc, 20:1) gave α,β-unsaturated ester 26 (2.26
g, 98%): colorless oil; α,β-unsaturated ester 26, yield (2.26 g, 98%) Rf
= 0.46 (hexane/EtOAc, 4:1); [α]25 D +17.9 (c 0.60, CHCl3); IR (CHCl3)
2954, 1717 cm-1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.35-7.25 (m, 15 H), 6.91 (dd,
J = 15.8, 6.0 Hz, 1 H), 6.03 (dd, J = 15.8, 1.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.74 (d, J =
11.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.69 (d, J = 11.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.60 (d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1 H),
4.56 (d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.53 (d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.42 (d, J = 11.6
Hz, 1 H), 4.26 (td, J = 5.6, 1.2 Hz, 1 H), 3.81-3.75 (m, 1 H), 3.72 (s, 3
H), 3.64-3.57 (m, 1 H), 3.55-3.48 (m, 2 H), 1.86-1.77 (m, 1 H), 1.74-1.65
(m, 1 H), 0.87 (s, 9 H), 0.01 (s, 3 H), 0.01 (s, 3 H); 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 166.6, 145.7, 138.7, 138.3, 137.9, 128.6, 128.5, 128.4, 128.1,
127.9, 127.8, 127.6, 122.4, 82.2, 79.0, 76.0, 74.8, 72.6, 71.9, 59.3,
51.7, 33.4, 26.1, 18.3, -5.3, -5.3; HRMS (FAB) calcd for C36H48O6SiNa (M
+Na)+ 627.3118, found:627.3110.
