$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound 13. NaH (60 wt% dispersion in oil, 338 mg, 9.44 mmol) was
dissolved in 15 mL of THF. (EtO)2POCH2CO2Et (2.32 g, 10.38 mmol) was
added dropwise to the above solution at 0 °C. After 30 min, methyl ketone
12 (1.54 g, 4.72 mmol) in 10 mL THF was added at 0 °C and warmed to room
temperature for 19 h. Aq. NH4Cl (40 mL) was added and the layers were
separated. The aqueous layer was extracted with EtOAc and the combined
organic layers were washed with brine, dried over NaSO4. After
filtration, the organic phase was concentrated and purified by flash
chromatography (Et2O/hexanes 1:20) to afford 13. Colorless oil, yield
1.75 g, 93%. [α]24 D = -44.2 (c = 1.63, CHCl3); IR (film): 3077, 2959,
2931, 2857, 1717, 1653, 1473, 1428, 1220, 1157, 1111, 1088, 1041, 826,
702 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.69-7.66 (m, 2H), 7.62-7.59 (m, 2H),
7.44-7.32 (m, 6H), 5.86 (s, 1H), 4.22-4.11 (m, 3H), 2.06 (s, 3H), 1.31
(t, J= 7.1 Hz, 3H), 1.16 (d, J= 6.4 Hz, 3H), 1.08 (s, 9H); 13C NMR (75
MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.1, 161.3, 135.8, 134.0, 133.4, 129.7, 127.6, 114.2,
73.8, 59.6, 26.9, 22.8, 19.2, 14.7, 14.3; MS (ESI): m/z 419.2 [M+Na]+;
HRMS (ESI) calcd for C24H32O3SiNa+ [M+Na]+: 419.3157, found: 419.2013.
