$DATUM 7732-18-5
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (E)-dec-2-en-1-ol (16). To a solution of ethyl
2-(diethoxyphosphoryl)acetate (8.3 g, 37.5 mmol) in THF (100 mL) at -78
°C, nBuLi (1.6 M in hexanes, 23.4 mL, 37.5 mmol) was added dropwise. The
reaction was stirred for 15 min and then a solution of aldehyde 15 (4.0
g, 31.2 mmol) in THF (20 mL) was added dropwise. The dark yellow solution
was stirred at -78 °C for 30 min, and then a saturated NH4Cl solution (20
mL) was added. The mixture was warmed to rt and diluted with H2O (20 mL).
The layers were separated, and the aqueous was extracted 2XEtOAc (30 mL).
The organics were dried, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo. The
resulting oil was purified by flash column chromatography (5%
EtOAc/Hexanes). 5.5 g (90%) of ester as a colorless oil.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, dropwise addition of n-BuLi/hexane stage 1 and aldehyde
solution stage 2, Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Novel malyngamide structural analogs: synthesis and biological evaluation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
