$DATUM (2E,4S,6E,8S,10E,12S)-14-(4-methoxybenzyloxy)-4,8,12-tri(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)tetradeca-2,6,10-trienal
(18). To a solution of 17b (50 mg, 0.071 mmol) in benzene (3 mL) was
added (triphenylphosphoranylidene)acetaldehyde (35 mg, 0.11 mmol). The
reaction mixture was heated at 80°C for 14 h. Concentration and radial
chromatography (petroleum ether/EtOAc) afforded an inseparable mixture of
minor isomers (2.5 mg, 4.8%) and isomerically pure 18 (46.0 mg, 89%
yield). [α]D23 +3.8 (c 0.98, CHCl3); IR (film) 2955, 2928, 2856, 1693,
1613, 1514, 1462, 1361, 1250, 1087 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.55
(d, J= 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.26-7.24 (m, 2H), 6.89-6.85 (m, 2H), 6.78 (dd, J=
15.5, 4.2 Hz, 1H), 6.26 (ddd, J= 15.5, 8.0, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 5.60-5.47 (m,
3H), 5.43 (dd, J= 15.2, 6.1 Hz, 1H), 4.49- 4.40 (m, 1H), 4.40 (ABq, Δν =
15.6 Hz, J= 11.4 Hz, 1H), 4.23 (dddd, J= 6.2, 6.2, 6.2, 3.8 Hz, 1H),
4.11-4.02 (m, 1H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.58-3.42 (m, 2H), 2.40-2.28 (m, 2H),
2.25-2.10 (m, 2H), 1.73 (m, apparent q, J= 6.3 Hz, 2H), 0.90 (s, 9H),
0.87 (s, 18H), 0.07 (s, 3H), 0.04 (s, 3H), 0.031 (s, 3H), 0.026 (s, 3H),
0.01 (s, 3H), -0.01 (s, 3H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 193.8, 159.7,
159.3, 136.1, 132.2, 130.9, 129.5, 126.0, 124.3, 113.9, 72.8, 71.7, 70.5,
66.8, 55.5, 41.6, 40.4, 38.6, 29.9, 26.1, 26.0, 18.4, 1.2, -3.9, -4.2,
-4.5, -4.6; MS (ESI) m/z (relative intensity) 750.02 ([M+NH4]+, 100%);
HRMS (ES) Calcd. for C40H72NNaO6Si3 ([M+Na]+): 755.4534, Found: 755.4537.
