2.63-2.51 (m, 1H), 1.95 (s, 3H), 1.82 (s, 3H), 1.31 (t, J = 6.8 Hz, 3H),
1.0 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 3H), 0.91 (s, 9H), 0.05 (s, 3H), 0.02 (s, 3H); 13C
NMR (CDCl3, 75 MHz) δ 169.0, 159.0, 142.9, 138.2, 134.6, 131.6, 130.4,
