$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (E)-Ethyl 6-(benzyloxy)hex-2-enoate (12) 2 To a stirred solution of
Ph3P=CHCO2Et (11.7 g, 33.45 mmol) in benzene (40 mL), was added the
aldehyde 8a (4.0 g, 22.3 mmol) in benzene (20 mL) at 90 °C. After 4h, the
solvent was removed under reduced pressure and the crude product was
purified by silica gel column chromatography using hexane-ethyl acetate
(1:9) as eluent to afford the title compound 12 (4.6 g, 84%) as a
colorless liquid; IR (KBr): ν 2938, 2862, 1718, 1651, 1451, 1367, 1312,
1272, 1204, 1173, 1109, 1040, 981, 709 cm-1; 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.35-7.20 (m, 5H), 7.0-6.82 (m, 1H), 5.77 (d, J = 15.5 Hz, 1H), 4.47 (s,
2H), 4.16 (q, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 3.42 (t, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 2.27-2.13 (m,
2H), 1.66-1.34 (m, 2H), 1.30 (t, J = 6.9 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 166.5, 148.4, 138.3, 128.2, 127.5, 127.4, 121.5, 72.8, 69.1, 60.0,
28.8, 28.0, 14.1; ESIMS (m/z) : C15H20O3Na [M + Na]+: 271
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
