$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Olefin (13) To a solution of sulfone 4 (622 mg, 0.93 mmol) in DME (20 mL)
was added KHMDS (1.85 mL, 0.5 M soln in toluene, 0.93 mmol) at -78 °C.
The reaction mixture was stirred for 30 min before a soln of aldehyde 5
(412 mg, 1.3 mmol) in DME (3 ml) was transferred in. The reaction mixture
was stirred for another 30 min before it was warmed up to rt. The
reaction was quenched by sat NH4Cl (10 mL) at -78 °C. The organic layer
was separated and the aq layer was extracted with diethyl ether (3 x 20
mL). The combined organic layers were washed with water and brine, dried
on anhyd MgSO4 and evaporated in vacuo. The crude product was purified by
flash chromatography (EtOAc/hexane 1: 30) to give the olefin 13 as a
colorless oil (580 mg, 83% yield). Rf value (EtOAc/hexane 1: 10): 0.52.
[α]23 D = +33.1 (c 2.0, CHCl3); IR (film, cm-1) 2931, 1461, 1253, 1098;
1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.27-7.33 (m, 5H), 5.60-5.66 (m, 1H), 5.42 (dt,
J = 4.2, 1.4 Hz, 1H), 5.27 (dd, J = 15.5, 8.6 Hz, 1H), 4.97 (s, 1H), 4.89
(s, 1H), 4.65 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.60 (AB, J AB = 11.8 Hz, ΔυAB = 18.6
Hz, 2H), 4.38 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.33 (dd, J = 8.0, 5.2 Hz, 1H),
4.18-4.19 (m 1H), 4.14 (dd, J = 9.0, 3.8 Hz, 1H), 3.83-3.88 (m, 1H), 3.80
(t, J = 8.7 Hz, 1H), 3.44 (dd, J = 12.0, 9.8 Hz, 2H), 3.34(s, 3H),
2.63-2.69 (m, 1H), 2.14-2.30 (m, 6H), 1.76 (d, J = 1.4 Hz 3H), 1.48 (s,
3H), 1.39 (s, 3H), 1.17 (s, 3H), 0.96 (s, 3H), 0.94 (s, 9H), 0.90 (s,
9H), ), 0.1(s, 6H), 0.09 (s, 3H), 0.08 (s, 3H); 13C NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 143.6, 138.3, 138.1, 131.7, 131.4, 129.6, 128.3, 127.5, 127.4, 127.3,
114.3, 107.3, 93.1, 81.6, 79.2, 78.4, 75.1, 73.5, 70.7, 59.9, 55.4, 43.9,
39.7, 39.2, 36.6, 28.7, 26.5, 26.0, 25.9, 19.3, 18.8, 18.4, 18.1, 15.5,
-4.5, -4.6, -5.1, -5.2; MS (ESI, m/z) [M+Na]+ 783.6. HRMS (ESI) [M+K]+
calcd for C43H76O7Si2K 799.4767, found 799.4760.
