$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Olefin S23. To a solution of diol S22 (123.6 mg, 0.1320 mmol) in
CH2Cl2/DMSO (1:1, v/v, 2.0 mL) at 0 °C were added Et3N (0.10 mL, 0.72
mmol) and SO3·pyridine (84.0 mg, 0.528 mmol), and the resultant mixture
was stirred at room temperature for 30 min. The reaction mixture was
diluted with Et2O and washed successively with 1 M aqueous HCl solution,
saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution, and brine. The organic layer was dried
over MgSO4, filtered, and concentrated under reduced pressure. The
residual aldehyde was used in the next reaction without further
purification. To a suspension of Ph3P+CH3Br- (155.0 mg, 0.4339 mmol) in
THF (1.5 mL) at 0 °C was added NaHMDS (1.0 M solution in THF, 0.40 mL,
0.40 mmol), and the resultant suspension was stirred at 0 °C for 30 min.
To the resultant suspension at -78 °C was added a solution of the above
aldehyde in THF (0.6 mL + 0.3 mL rinse), and the reaction mixture was
stirred at 0 °C for 2 h. The reaction mixture was diluted with saturated
aqueous NH4Cl solution and extracted with EtOAc. The organic layer was
washed with H2O and brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated
under reduced pressure. The residue was purified by column chromatography
(silica gel, 30 to 40% EtOAc/hexanes) to give olefin S23 for the two
steps. Colorless oil, yield 101.2 mg, 83%. [α]D 24 +14.3 (c 0.31, C6H6);
IR (film) 3050, 2933, 2868, 1541, 1457, 1374, 1339, 1123, 1087, 815, 771,
679 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.82-7.71 (m, 12H), 7.47-7.38 (m,
9H), 5.83 (ddd, J = 17.5, 11.0, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 5.31 (m, 1H), 5.20 (m, 1H),
4.72-4.59 (m, 5H), 4.47 (d, J = 11.5 Hz, 1H), 4.24 (m, 1H), 3.79 (m, 1H),
3.71-3.66 (m, 2H), 3.60-3.47 (m, 3H), 3.45-3.36 (m, 2H), 3.28 (ddd, J =
11.0, 11.0, 5.0 Hz, 1H), 3.06 (dd, J = 12.0, 3.0 Hz, 1H), 2.21 (m, 1H),
2.16-2.06 (m, 2H), 2.02 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1H), 1.90-1.82 (m, 2H),
1.76-1.59 (m, 11H), 1.34 (br s, 1H), 1.28-1.23 (m, 7H), 0.95 (d, J = 6.5
Hz, 3H), 0.87 (d, J = 6.5 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ 136.4,
136.2, 135.8, 133.6, 133.3, 133.2, 132.95, 132.92, 132.88, 128.2, 128.1,
128.0, 127.9, 127.88, 127.83, 127.79, 127.7, 127.63, 127.59, 126.37,
126.35, 126.12 (2C), 126.06, 126.03, 125.9 (2C), 125.8, 125.7, 125.63,
125.61, 117.7, 88.1, 85.2, 82.0, 81.7, 81.0, 80.2, 74.8, 73.9, 73.2,
73.0, 71.9, 71.4, 70.85, 70.83, 68.3, 53.3. 42.1, 41.2, 40.1, 35.1, 33.1,
32.2, 31.1, 26.7, 25.2, 23.8, 17.2, 15.9, 13.9; HRMS (ESI) calcd for
C61H72O8Na [(M + Na)+] 955.5125, found 955.5119.
